---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { workflowSections } from '../../lib/workflow';
import { withBase } from '../../lib/paths';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Research Workflow"
  description="A question-led A–E DFT manual: define the required observable, select a bounded target calculation, and follow evidence back when necessary."
  current="operations"
>
  <article class="workflow-manual">
    <header class="workflow-lede">
      <h1>Choose the calculation your question requires</h1>
      <p class="page-intro">
        Write the scientific question as a comparison or decision, then identify the observable and precision it requires. Use A–C to establish a defensible model and reference state, choose only the D calculation that produces that observable, and use E to decide what the evidence supports.
      </p>
    </header>

    <section class="observable-selection" aria-labelledby="observable-heading">
      <header>
        <h2 id="observable-heading">Choose the evidence before the calculation</h2>
        <p>Different claims require different outputs. Start with the question, then open the task that produces or tests the needed quantity.</p>
      </header>
      <dl>
        <div>
          <dt>Is the structure stable for the claim I want to make?</dt>
          <dd>
            Candidate ranking requires <a href={withBase('operations/relative-and-formation-energies/')}>matched energy differences</a>; a stationary geometry requires <a href={withBase('operations/optimize-structure/')}>accepted forces and stress</a>; dynamical stability requires <a href={withBase('operations/harmonic-phonons/')}>phonons over the relevant q-space</a>. Choose the test that matches the claim.
          </dd>
        </div>
        <div>
          <dt>Is the material metallic?</dt>
          <dd>
            Inspect a sufficiently dense <a href={withBase('operations/fermi-surface-and-full-brillouin-zone-analysis/')}>full-zone electronic sample</a> and the <a href={withBase('operations/density-of-states-and-projected-density-of-states/')}>density of states near the Fermi level</a>. A high-symmetry band path alone is not full-Brillouin-zone evidence of metallicity.
          </dd>
        </div>
        <div>
          <dt>Is the reference crystal dynamically stable in the harmonic approximation?</dt>
          <dd>
            Calculate <a href={withBase('operations/harmonic-phonons/')}>harmonic phonons</a> over the q-space required by the claim, then test the q mesh or supercell and inspect possible numerical artifacts. A Γ-point result is not a general stability test.
          </dd>
        </div>
        <div>
          <dt>Could conventional electron–phonon superconductivity be supported?</dt>
          <dd>
            Establish qualified <a href={withBase('operations/harmonic-phonons/')}>phonons</a>, converge the <a href={withBase('operations/electron-phonon-coupling/')}>electron–phonon calculation</a>, and inspect α²F(ω), λ, ω<sub>log</sub>, the stated μ*, and the declared <a href={withBase('operations/conventional-superconductivity/')}>Tc model</a>. SCF convergence and one phonon calculation do not establish Tc.
          </dd>
        </div>
      </dl>
    </section>

    <section class="topic-directory" aria-labelledby="directory-heading">
      <header class="directory-heading">
        <h2 id="directory-heading">Choose the next task</h2>
        <p>Open the task that produces or checks the object you need. D is grouped by target quantity; this directory is not a required linear sequence.</p>
      </header>

      {workflowSections.map((section) => (
        <section class="part-section" id={`part-${section.id.toLowerCase()}`} aria-labelledby={`part-${section.id.toLowerCase()}-heading`}>
          <header>
            <h2 id={`part-${section.id.toLowerCase()}-heading`}>{section.id} · {section.title}</h2>
            <p>{section.summary}</p>
          </header>

          {section.groups.map((group) => (
            <div class="workflow-group">
              {section.id === 'D' && <h3>{group.id} · {group.title}</h3>}
              {section.id === 'D' && <p class="group-summary">{group.summary}</p>}
              <ul class="directory-list topic-list">
                {group.topics.map((topic) => (
                  <li><a href={withBase(`operations/${topic.slug}/`)}>{topic.title}</a></li>
                ))}
              </ul>
            </div>
          ))}
        </section>
      ))}
    </section>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .workflow-manual {
    --ink: #181714;
    --muted: #666158;
    --rule: #d9d4ca;
    --accent: #8a3f28;
    color: var(--ink);
    max-width: 76rem;
  }

  .workflow-lede {
    max-width: 58rem;
    padding: clamp(0.5rem, 2vw, 1.5rem) 0 clamp(2.5rem, 5vw, 4rem);
  }

  h1 {
    font-size: clamp(2.9rem, 5.5vw, 5.4rem);
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: -0.045em;
    line-height: 0.96;
    margin: 0;
    max-width: 14ch;
  }

  .page-intro {
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: clamp(1.08rem, 1.8vw, 1.3rem);
    line-height: 1.58;
    margin: 1.6rem 0 0;
    max-width: 45em;
  }

  .observable-selection,
  .topic-directory {
    border-top: 1px solid var(--ink);
  }

  .observable-selection {
    padding: 1.35rem 0 clamp(3rem, 6vw, 5rem);
  }

  .observable-selection > header {
    max-width: 52rem;
  }

  .observable-selection h2,
  .directory-heading h2 {
    font-size: clamp(1.55rem, 2.6vw, 2.35rem);
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: -0.025em;
    line-height: 1.1;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .observable-selection > header > p,
  .directory-heading > p {
    color: var(--muted);
    line-height: 1.55;
  }

  .observable-selection > header > p {
    margin: 0.75rem 0 0;
  }

  .observable-selection dl {
    margin: 2rem 0 0;
  }

  .observable-selection dl > div {
    border-top: 1px solid var(--rule);
    display: grid;
    gap: 1rem 4rem;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(15rem, 0.85fr) minmax(22rem, 1.6fr);
    padding: 1.1rem 0 1.35rem;
  }

  .observable-selection dt {
    font-size: 1.04rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    line-height: 1.35;
  }

  .observable-selection dd {
    color: var(--muted);
    line-height: 1.55;
    margin: 0.65rem 0 0;
  }

  .observable-selection dd a {
    color: var(--ink);
    font-weight: 700;
    text-underline-offset: 0.16em;
  }

  .observable-selection dd a:hover,
  .observable-selection dd a:focus-visible {
    color: var(--accent);
  }

  .topic-directory {
    padding-top: 1.25rem;
  }

  .directory-heading {
    display: grid;
    gap: 0 4rem;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(12rem, 0.8fr) minmax(20rem, 2fr);
    margin-bottom: 3rem;
  }

  .directory-heading > p {
    margin: 0.15rem 0 0;
  }

  .part-section {
    border-top: 1px solid var(--rule);
    display: grid;
    gap: 1.5rem 4rem;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(16rem, 0.8fr) minmax(0, 2fr);
    padding: 1.5rem 0 clamp(3rem, 6vw, 5rem);
    scroll-margin-top: 1rem;
  }

  .part-section > header h2 {
    font-size: clamp(1.45rem, 2.8vw, 2.25rem);
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: -0.025em;
    line-height: 1.05;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .part-section > header p,
  .group-summary {
    color: var(--muted);
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  .part-section > header p {
    margin: 0.8rem 0 0;
  }

  .workflow-group {
    grid-column: 2;
  }

  .workflow-group + .workflow-group {
    margin-top: 1.5rem;
  }

  .workflow-group h3 {
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .group-summary {
    margin: 0.45rem 0 1rem;
  }

  .topic-list {
    list-style: none;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
  }

  .topic-list li {
    border-top: 1px solid var(--rule);
  }

  .topic-list a {
    align-items: baseline;
    color: inherit;
    display: flex;
    gap: 1rem;
    justify-content: space-between;
    line-height: 1.35;
    padding: 0.72rem 0;
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  .topic-list a::after {
    color: var(--accent);
    content: "→";
    flex: 0 0 auto;
  }

  .topic-list a:hover,
  .topic-list a:focus-visible {
    color: var(--accent);
  }

  @media (max-width: 80rem) {
    .part-section {
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr);
    }

    .workflow-group {
      grid-column: 1;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 56.25rem) {
    .workflow-lede {
      padding-top: 0.5rem;
    }

    .directory-heading,
    .part-section {
      display: block;
    }

    .observable-selection dl > div {
      gap: 0.6rem;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .observable-selection dd {
      margin-top: 0;
    }

    .directory-heading > p,
    .workflow-group {
      margin-top: 2rem;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 44rem) {
    h1 {
      font-size: clamp(2.8rem, 12vw, 4.2rem);
    }

    .directory-heading > p,
    .workflow-group {
      margin-top: 1.4rem;
    }
  }
</style>
